:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Ritual Cat (Enemy)]].''
'''Salaryman Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked when beating any stage in [[Loving Labour (Monthly Event)|Loving Labour]]. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.7 Update|Version 2.0.7]]. [[True Form]] increases health, attack power and knockbacks, in addition to gaining double damage at 50% health. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], Salaryman Cat is added to the [[Rare Cat Capsule]] pool once clearing [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Stage 48]] from Chapter One.

